Hy4 Vision
This release includes vision weights from Tencent Hy4.
Source: https://huggingface.co/tencent/Hy4/tree/c10c0de5b6f850703fb0a90e65d1c32b558b9167
The weights are redistributed under the Tencent Hy License, Version 1.0.

Changes: extracted the Tower and Projector from the parent checkpoint,
removed the vit. prefix from tensor names, and added standalone modeling
code. The benchmark uses 512-pixel RGB crops and omits image_newline tokens
from the projected features. The original tensor values are preserved.
